      "id": 0,
      "kind": "prep",
      "primary_message": "Cut the ruby grapefruits into segments, then reserve the juice. Cut the ripe avocados in half, then slice them 1/4 inch thick. Dice the red onion fine. Grind the aji panca.",
      "secondary_message": "2 large ruby grapefruits\n2 ripe avocados\n4 to 6 tbsp red onion, divided\n4 tsp aji panca"
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Arrange grapefruit and avocado on four plates. Top with sprinkles of red onion and aji panca. On each plate, drizzle 2 teaspoons reserved grapefruit juice over avocado slices, covering well to prevent browning. Then drizzle 1 tablespoon olive oil over each plate. Add salt, mostly on avocado, to taste, starting with 1/4 teaspoon per plate. Serve immediately.",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
